Merge pull request #40 from ihumphrey-usgs/LidarData-json

LidarData json and binary serialization
@makaylas approves this message

[warnings] Fixed compilation warnings

Here is the syntax of a typedef struct:
```
typedef struct <non-required structure name> {
  ...
} <actual mandatory name of the type>;
```

Example when defining a list type:
```
typedef struct __list_node {
  int value;
  struct __list_node *next;
} list_t;
```

Including package networks

Including this line to make it work:
package networks;
import ned.DatarateChannel;
import ned.DelayChannel;

